OL,3,GNEWSATrust 'exploring ways' to keep    
OL,4,Arural school open                      
OL,6,FThe trust which oversees a school at   
OL,7,Frisk of closure due to low numbers has 
OL,8,Fpledged to "explore ways" to increase  
OL,9,Fenrolments.                            
OL,11,FBranscombe Church of England Primary   
OL,12,FSchool in Devon has just six pupils and
OL,13,FLink Academy Trust has started a       
OL,14,Fprocess that could see it closed, the  
OL,15,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service said.
OL,17,FIn an open letter, trust chief         
OL,18,Fexecutive Rachael Sharpe said renewed  
OL,19,Feffort would be put into keeping the   
OL,20,Fsite going but she acknowledged the    
OL,21,Fnational "challenge of sustaining small
OL,22,Fschools".                              
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
